    <h1>Sweet spots we're loving this week</h1>
    <p>
      Turkish Airlines business class from the US to Europe is still the best
      deal going at 45,000 miles one-way &mdash; transfer Capital One at 1:1.
    </p>
    <p>
      Prefer to save the miles? Avianca LifeMiles economy from North America to
      Europe is just 30,000 miles, one of the cheapest ways across the Atlantic.
    </p>
    <p>
      For a domestic hop, Aeroplan prices Within North America economy from
      12,500 miles &mdash; great for a transcon.
    </p>
    <p>
      Heads up: that &ldquo;earn 100,000 points&rdquo; Amex Gold bonus is a
      welcome offer, not an award price &mdash; don't confuse the two.
    </p>
